Start your MySQL server and make sure the database is active.

Confirm your project folder has app.py, config.py, and a templates folder with index.html.

Be sure to check config.py! Config it! 

Open a terminal and navigate to the project folder using cd.

Run the app with python app.py (or your full Python path if needed).

Open a browser and go to http://localhost:5000.

Use the form to enter a record ID and a new checkout total, then click update.

